


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d94e9ca9:


    "在下课铃还没响完时，文就飞奔到伦的座位前。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_8e63b0ae:



    voice "FUM_0621"
    fumi "「我们快点回去吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_0dcc2d84:



    voice "RIN_0634"
    rin "「教室的窗户谁来关？在阳菜病假的时候——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_6fc9fa83:



    voice "FUM_0622"
    fumi "「已经拜托给其他人了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_1693cc5a:



    voice "RIN_0635"
    rin "「反正也拜托祥子姐照顾阳菜了，没必要那么着急……喂，呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ab6209b4:


    "不等伦说完，文就拽着她的胳膊跑了出去。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_75c41bad:



    voice "SYO_0127"
    sachiko "「啊，欢迎回——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d4366ffb:



    voice "RIN_0636"
    rin "「我回——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_8b5d7710:


    "祥子和伦连招呼都没打完，文就跑了过去，飞快地前往房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_cc3dde50:



    voice "FUM_0623"
    fumi "「阳菜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ae114f93:



    voice "HIN_0805"
    hina "「啊，欢迎回来，小文」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_f0ca0a91:


    "阳菜像没事人一样坐在床上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_fbdd4535:



    voice "FUM_0624"
    fumi "「你已经没事了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_9c9bca0c:



    voice "HIN_0806"
    hina "「嗯，中午的时候烧也退下去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_f668b808:



    voice "FUM_0625"
    fumi "「太好了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_a607fd59:


    "书包从手上滑下去，啪嗒一声掉落在了门口处。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_dad1f93e:


    "文蹒跚走到床边后，扑通一声软软地跪坐了下去。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_371a0792:



    voice "HIN_0807"
    hina "「谢谢你给我熬的粥，非常好喝」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_7381d0e9:


    "看过去，早上文熬的粥，已经全被吃光了，锅里都是空的。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_916b1d7d:



    voice "HIN_0808"
    hina "「但是喝了粥，很快就又饿了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ccec315d:


    "阳菜摸着肚皮叹气道，已经恢复到平时的状态了。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_8246bc52:



    voice "FUM_0626"
    fumi "「我马上去做——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_f4b80342:


    "文赶紧准备起身，阳菜一下抓住了她的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_88194988:



    voice "HIN_0809"
    hina "「那个」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_989ae30c:


    "阳菜直勾勾地看着文。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_e0dcb35a:



    voice "HIN_0810"
    hina "「……昨晚你亲了我的额头？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_9e6ca4f6:


    "阳菜问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_2524b056:



    voice "FUM_0627"
    fumi "「啊，那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_06d52678:


    "踌躇不语的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_3cf344f4:



    voice "HIN_0811"
    hina "「果然是我做梦啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_9922165d:


    "阳菜这么说着，放开了文的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_c517a175:



    voice "HIN_0812"
    hina "「抱歉，问了你奇怪的问题」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_f7308e18:



    voice "FUM_0628"
    fumi "「那个……不是梦」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d905b7e9:


    "文低着头承认道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_9a04ae00:



    voice "FUM_0629"
    fumi "「……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_fe512ac0:



    voice "HIN_0813"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_8aec4bb4:


    "两人之间沉默了一会儿。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ff4bc928:



    voice "HIN_0814"
    hina "「这样啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_2cd710d3:



    voice "FUM_0630"
    fumi "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_522e2f4f:



    voice "HIN_0815"
    hina "「小文的嘴唇软软的好舒服。肯定是因为那个吻的效果，烧才退下去的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_941df49f:


    "阳菜说完，露齿一笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d2719fa4:



    voice "FUM_0631"
    fumi "「阳菜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_a53da330:



    voice "HIN_0816"
    hina "「等我痊愈了，就再——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_5e25f8b9:


    "说完之前，文已经亲上了阳菜的额头。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_e5b3bb18:



    voice "HIN_0817"
    hina "「啊哈，果然很柔软——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_0b28c4da:


    "接着亲了嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_1914bef9:



    voice "HIN_0818"
    hina "「小文？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ffe7a784:



    voice "FUM_0632"
    fumi "「……诶，啊！对不起，不知怎么就！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_1026c6e2:


    "反应过来的文道歉道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ee5d2181:



    voice "FUM_0633"
    fumi "「我，我都做了些什么啊！？一看到阳菜，不自觉就，那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_9de85ef8:



    voice "HIN_0819"
    hina "「嗯……是小文的话可以喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_4b9bd160:



    voice "FUM_0634"
    fumi "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_1c777468:



    voice "HIN_0820"
    hina "「不如说……我现在，非常开心」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_845c091b:



    voice "FUM_0635"
    fumi "「……啊啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_3df404af:



    voice "FUM_0636"
    fumi "「阳菜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_b2059101:


    "文激动地抱住阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_a3ac2c95:



    voice "HIN_0821"
    hina "「都说了会传染给你的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_f6b96338:



    voice "FUM_0637"
    fumi "「没事。我身体免疫力强」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d1b558db:



    voice "HIN_0822"
    hina "「……小文」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_e248860d:



    voice "FUM_0638"
    fumi "「啊，我可不是笨蛋哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_e5f5f794:



    voice "HIN_0823"
    hina "「谁都没说你是笨蛋啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_0276acbf:



    voice "FUM_0639"
    fumi "「我只是想在被你说之前先讲清楚」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_2876bdd9:



    voice "HIN_0824"
    hina "「……啊哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_6f0d35b2:



    voice "FUM_0640"
    fumi "「……呵呵」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_dfa9c9df:


    "两人开心地笑着，更加用力地抱紧彼此。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d0cd851f:



    voice "HIN_0825"
    hina "「……小文」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_c05250b4:



    voice "FUM_0641"
    fumi "「是什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_a1b79ff4:



    voice "HIN_0826"
    hina "「我喜欢小文。大概不是朋友的，喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_a69b0966:



    voice "FUM_0642"
    fumi "「我也喜欢阳菜。一定不是朋友的，喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d31f7af1:



    voice "HIN_0827"
    hina "「呜呜……我好像又要发烧了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_7df3847a:



    voice "FUM_0643"
    fumi "「啊哇哇！对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_ded92b4a:


    "文慌张地松开拥抱。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_706c10a8:



    voice "HIN_0828"
    hina "「……不是那种感觉。而是心脏扑通扑通地乱跳，全身发热」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_4e5fcff0:



    voice "FUM_0644"
    fumi "「那我也是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_84c0f1ed:


    "至于另一边的走廊上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_d2864b19:



    voice "RIN_0637"
    rin "「这……我不好进去了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_63e22f86:


    "伦背靠着门低声说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_b9b3a304:



    voice "SYO_0128"
    sachiko "「嗯？你怎么不进屋？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_c56a1b20:



    voice "RIN_0638"
    rin "「啊！那个，这个，我突然有点头晕」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_0d899b99:



    voice "SYO_0129"
    sachiko "「没问题吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_696ee459:



    voice "RIN_0639"
    rin "「没事，一点事都没有。除了不能马上进屋之外什么事都没有！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_09_06e3cec8:



    voice "SYO_0130"
    sachiko "「……你是不是也发烧了？」"
